@startuml state_machine
title Watcher daemon - state machine
[*] --> Loading : fiaudit watch
Loading --> Refused : baseline integrity fails\nor log chain broken (no --force)
Refused --> [*] : exit 2
Loading --> Starting : baseline + log OK
Starting : add inotify watches (recursive)\nlog "watch started"\ninitial full scan
Starting --> Idle
state Monitoring {
  Idle : epoll_wait(inotify, eventfd, timeout)
  Idle --> Collecting : inotify readable
  Collecting : drain events\nschedule(path, debounce)
  Collecting --> Idle
  Idle --> Analysing : debounce timer expired
  Analysing : worker: hash + classify\nAuditor.record()
  Analysing --> Idle
  Idle --> Rescanning : IN_Q_OVERFLOW
  Rescanning --> Idle
}
Idle --> Reloading : SIGHUP (eventfd wake-up)
Reloading --> Idle : new baseline loaded + rescan
Reloading --> Idle : load failed -> TAMPER record,\nkeep old baseline
Idle --> Stopping : SIGINT / SIGTERM
Stopping : flush pending paths\nwait for workers\nlog "watch stopped"
Stopping --> [*] : exit 0
@enduml
